  <h1 slot="sheet">Three parts. One local presence.</h1>
  <p>Acquiring connects your volume to local acquirers in Latin America, at local prices. Local signup gathers your data for the local partners, so the approval has a better chance. A direct connection means you use the volume of our local commercial policy and enter the competitive market, instead of meeting each requirement on your own. We are online enablers where we have structure: the business brings its stock, and the digitised store includes the card terminal for online sales. Settlement sends money collected locally to you in as few steps as possible.</p>
  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <p>We do not take our clients' merchants. We do not dispute their accounts. We do not do fulfilment or shipping. Two niches, no conflict of interest.</p>
